-- ==================================================================
--  HIGH-PING FREEZE
--  ping >= HI  -> everything freezes in place (loops, timers, buying, rolling)
--  ping <= LO for HOLD seconds -> everything continues exactly where it stopped
--  Only the ping check itself keeps running while frozen.
-- ==================================================================
